    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b345b401adb715d25e2aab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了……！\r\n还请再多多展现给我看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ceedb495e55f19beda06dba9fd920f5b8b56e79d1e9e5c6c0fefb381182b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fb10a71b1fbd13dcdbea65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也要好好地\r\n行善积德喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a22f24eaf3ee1e633c0c25bc778a9bc4379eb3ad7d2a28ea1b1e5b512a6b096a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4150cdb8bba3d1ca64b86973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天早上也在速子醒来前\r\n就离开宿舍了！\r\n因为我不想在早晨打扰到我的推嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "024fe697583d8d3d42889f91effddca12afb01421128d63181425dcb717484ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be5bd2349923d5dde0c1d083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！今天是个超棒的赛马娘\r\n好日子呢～♪我要完全隐藏气息，\r\n把自己变成一堵墙喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a35bb1a95db6d013e0a1b611d79d9d0f68ff74227ec8099aee2587dc4f1785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89a3d30dd50038c1cf974c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呼～！现在食堂中\r\n挤满了赛马娘……！\r\n我稍微去偷看一下好了……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f99443c11faaf937fc40f086d929f958b4d5f444db01a491498ae0b849fc21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cec0eee2772c2b2b6748e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了，已经天黑了。\r\n我们阿宅的本领\r\n要从现在开始才会发挥出来喔～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e115e9538e0cde50266eadc149a3f4629be709d68720c03daf1edfbcfd66f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efff64c7d67b507ff784100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做的事实在太多了。\r\n查看社交平台加上观赏比赛影片，\r\n还要画薄……咳，创作活动之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6b275b9b916925c2e37b1e79c9edee3188b394b192a2b49b5d7e717b525a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33079ac3bcec77adb2f6bd6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就想到……没错，赛马娘！\r\n当那女孩为自己拿掉头上的花瓣，\r\n那瞬间……两人的故事就此展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "652a49b38d56562300e7f3935eb68522ddf62eaa3994f03b6649ee68818adf07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:815715e470cab09b98736c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天是赛马娘的季节！\r\n跟那女孩借饮料瓶来喝了一口，\r\n那瞬间……两人的命运开始转动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0b2c0f393a741562fc36bed1f307eba6ea474b45b286fc7956da898c9f6ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3e1f0295d676dc5b08e9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天风情的代表就会想到赛马娘！\r\n在夕阳之下，那女孩微笑的瞬间……\r\n世界只属于她们两人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad6b1cba6ea044982be0563e1f45c41e419882588be1c836a393b1c96309d0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:225d35ba0e92da0c33517c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天果然就会想到赛马娘！\r\n虽是离别的季节，但那女孩说了\r\n要在一起……两人的故事将继续下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ceb193a4af4dc3ccceff5d11c999e12a2a080a2624e494590584403f96e99e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ffdf665f8961bb4953a4763",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "殭尸原本就很怕早上的太阳了，\r\n要是又被赛马娘早上的笑脸照耀，\r\n那我不就会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd4cbadddc204db0b6f9d7035bbf1b7fa0acb7dd4eb29ca2372ff7483aafc7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20520f38f9fcbb9b4ef779a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～我熬夜涉猎了各种殭尸作品，\r\n真是深奥呀～我还挺喜欢这种\r\n很夸张的设定喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "194ee8e8be7730f585ea8359b408b2c86815a85866a60aedbf80c6f938b86ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abadeb1373bbf3b4f850f524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都是赛马娘的学园──\r\n这里的空气就是阿宅殭尸的主食！\r\n我要享用午餐了！（吸气～～）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10c1769efdc11e87e153b4e51bb34a359e52084db521c3a7ba84d9c4f5bbca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a9686e112550a11ea42d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同志，志同道合的道士！帮、帮我\r\n贴上符咒！看到互相喂食的赛马娘\r\n让我兴奋到极限MAX啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6873923790d323f7ffcbd83d3487fd65801decf1b983c8bac7205b7fa7ac9bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3f35c11e59fb02ac7ea2c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，夜晚来临啰！\r\n殭尸跟阿宅都会在夜晚活动！\r\n创作，开始────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761ff905edd7d86ea3a8752c9f25ca82b3166bfbbab697a82703b6db36b4d20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2aa764452304f537efa71a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然道士拿出铜钱剑要击退殭尸，\r\n那我就用散发七色光芒的剑\r\n来与之对抗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f728ec7e79ec9b8d0a1984a17d6d1771cd9fcea9e31d88438be3fc39fca6f84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285c32076b843936292c4089",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～！闪亮亮的赛马娘新生！\r\n我明明该迎接她们到来，\r\n却好像要被接去天国了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb47ac99b6b87275a0091df1ae9f297562a9ece210ef3d54bd6c7cd628a67d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25fcdbedae47518291f8ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满头大汗害符咒都黏在脸上了……\r\n但没办法……这可是看到赛马娘\r\n令人兴奋的夏日模样而流的汗水！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a3054bb91edb90cd0f36d154aadd0990acbcd6e0788d377502993eb27a9cb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413f015c1d16ae26fe579274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲之秋来临了呢，呜嘻嘻……\r\n来去尽情吸取只有从赛马娘身上\r\n才摄取得到的营养吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aaf2444d2b3c532829a3efe21cf65dee3b724a75fc48e188011456ca9d64d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4cf6e4fcf9a24faf53aa296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了猫熊造型包子。\r\n但我比较想好好欣赏赛马娘\r\n大口享用猫熊包子的光景说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9871e7303053727c8789062c04351bff103911fc12bc0c4a3bcccefe1700adb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a96b24367000c0011c71c5aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662e748f176f0df85df64427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebfb177fbce71c9a1e86c79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么时候去演唱会，\r\n飞鹰子总是笑着对我挥手……\r\n难道她是神？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a932d23b4a3debc6e6f9677c703ae127a52cf0ad2ec67c48ef958058e9a575ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7eae432b9553ce3e57ce40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为父亲工作的关系，\r\n我可以轻松拿到想要的书。\r\n……啊，当然是正规管道咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a99d81c6a7850c7d94b8fe7937e8835c121b6b3b983a9fb772578e40e76420c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2814699209b43bfb32f47dea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好歌剧牵起怒涛的手\r\n走向赛道！？这这这样的画面，\r\n真的可以免费让我看吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c782cd03602272102e25998057f02d5e893166d01635a3c23a314c50a4b114b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d10b39432af071a0eb34297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在募集能隐藏气息的方法！\r\n想看的是我的推最自然的一面，\r\n但好像老是会让对方感受到视线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f301a129d55005437203e2be09c71c71345c4970307dceb3ae1acb2b26c08dc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6251b1e7b21c45c115cd993e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～～转车要十五分钟！？\r\n那可不行，会赶不上后半场的活动！\r\n该怎么做……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d370b9de1b73cf808fe7cfe206d16fd7446bf320e36a6204b14d650e5650b68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da68767bf982957d5856048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……！跟我的推她们一样的\r\n服装……！我会好好对待它，\r\n不让它出现丝毫损伤……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8576b795024e7ab3a9ffc635339ff98bb1fec589fb913660fb29134f0c4c8d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9def42ca0b2d490c9e4857e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然要站在舞台上给我的推看，\r\n怎么会有这种幸福的事！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8dc1d3b8243653fd31bba472bd33645a95f97093f94ec73c077155e2f15bb68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de2df4fefe2f4b1e9b66ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样……？为了让自己\r\n站在我的推身边不显失礼，\r\n在设计上已经尽力做到最好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "865402a77edf1e3178269941bbd8fa6f71208a052f0b5c710ca0c82b1a90032c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db761a6f148bbd573eb410e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢这种感觉的服装──\r\n呃，那个，被那样一直盯着看，\r\n我会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "138139823ec5a85db6d83963306dcefd205bc285821f414f9015d4899a93872c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ca2a61bb73cc193a51a0448",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会吧，从宿舍到学校这么短的距离\r\n居然要一起走过来……！这还真是\r\n……其中一定有什么内情吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b87c38711d6751028dca459fb05ba33fe27f7019d8e9532160fe92d8af26d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394979425eda22b7d695361a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面带笑容吃下胡萝卜面包的\r\n乌拉拉……我永远都看不腻……\r\n喜欢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d16ec7b4685e5f133cf34b4be283dcd869998d3b9dae3d502bd7fbafe959a0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aba9a839e0fc565ae328114f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞお手柔らかに\r\nお願いします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c41b816a3a353d35944cb616f8f088a72f7feefd5a7985c4efb3e033a27aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce03334628cbb63071b2340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶又更新了UG！？\r\n好辛苦，被我的推这么频繁地喂养，\r\n实在太尊太辛苦了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7565beb350243b159beb9c1e146ee2f50d670ff094417089784a25dd2364c90e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
